		<scroll-view id="demo-scroll" class="demo-scroll" direction="vertical">
			<demo-hero current-key="time-axis" />

			<view class="demo-shell">
				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="订单物流" desc="阶段用图标节点，同一阶段下的多条动态用圆点；当前节点用主色。" />
					<view class="demo-card">
						<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisOrderEntries" />
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">有 title 的是阶段，没有 title 的是事件；事件自动和上一条贴得更近，阶段之间留 24。首尾竖线各收在节点中心。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="节点类型" desc="type 表达状态；图标节点用实心底，没有图标时缩成圆点。" />
					<view class="demo-card">
						<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisTypeEntries" />
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">primary 当前进度、success 已完成、info 中性信息、warning 需留意、danger 异常、default 待处理；颜色不代替文字状态。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="尺寸" desc="节点 20 / 24 / 28，事件圆点 6 / 8 / 10；标题 13 / 15 / 17。" />
					<view class="demo-card">
						<view class="demo-timeaxis-group">
							<text class="demo-timeaxis-label">sm · 节点 20 / 圆点 6</text>
							<vx-time-axis size="sm" :items="timeAxisSizeEntries" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-timeaxis-group demo-timeaxis-group--md">
							<text class="demo-timeaxis-label">md · 节点 24 / 圆点 8</text>
							<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisSizeEntries" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-timeaxis-group demo-timeaxis-group--last">
							<text class="demo-timeaxis-label">lg · 节点 28 / 圆点 10</text>
							<vx-time-axis size="lg" :items="timeAxisSizeEntries" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">尺寸只改节点、圆点、间距和文字档位；说明在 sm 收到 13 / 20，md / lg 都用 15 / 22。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="事件与竖线" desc="同一阶段下的多条动态不写 title；lineColor 只改 1px 竖线。" />
					<view class="demo-card">
						<text class="demo-timeaxis-caption">默认线 · --vx-color-border</text>
						<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisEventEntries" />
						<text class="demo-timeaxis-caption demo-timeaxis-caption--spaced">lineColor #c7d7f2</text>
						<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisEventEntries" line-color="#c7d7f2" />
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">事件和阶段的分组只由数组顺序表达：下一条没有 title 时，当前条目的底部留白从 24 收到 12；单条记录不画竖线。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="订单卡片" desc="标题、单号和承运商交给卡片，时间轴只负责节点和文字。" />
					<vx-card title="物流详情" meta="9136257866">
						<vx-time-axis :items="timeAxisEventEntries" />
						<template #suffix>
							<view class="demo-timeaxis-card__foot">
								<text class="demo-timeaxis-card__meta">国内承运人：华南众包站</text>
								<vx-tag size="sm" type="primary" variant="soft" text="运输中" />
							</view>
						</template>
					</vx-card>
					<text class="demo-hint">时间轴不染色卡片，卡片也不改时间轴的文字层级；需要状态时在卡片底部放标签。</text>
				</view>

				<demo-page-nav current-key="time-axis" />

				<demo-footer />
			</view>
		</scroll-view>
	</view>
</template>

<script setup>
	import { demoIsDark, syncDemoTheme } from '@/pages/demo/shared/theme'

